    A[monday.com CRM] -->|Raw Deal Event| B{n8n Orchestration Engine}
    B -->|Calculate Stage Durations| B
    B -->|Normalize ARR & Win Rate| B
    B -->|Structured Metric Payload| C[Databox API]
    C -->|Real-Time Cards| D[Executive Dashboard UI]
```

